  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Past the bridge a man lay black with dust, too drunk to speak, swinging at my head.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 6.36
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Steady, man. Let me help you up.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 7.125,
      "seconds": 3.03
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The dust thickened toward Fulham. A dozen dead lay softened under it along the road.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 10.667,
      "seconds": 5.54
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Gold chains lay on the pavement. I left them. Beyond, a woman slept on a doorstep, dead.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 16.708,
      "seconds": 7.39
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A white terrace burned, and its roar was a mercy.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 24.625,
      "seconds": 4.09
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Near South Kensington a sound rose. Two notes, sobbing, over and over.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 29.25,
      "seconds": 6.5
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It was as though the empty houses had found a voice for their fear.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 36.25,
      "seconds": 4.4
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I slept in a public house, woke at dusk, and saw the crying giant above the park.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 46.125,
      "seconds": 5.42
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A dog ran past with red meat in its jaws, a starving pack behind it.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 52.083,
      "seconds": 4.89
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Too tired to fear, I went on, past a wrecked machine, toward a second silent giant.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 57.5,
      "seconds": 5.89
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "On the canal bridge, the cry stopped. The silence struck like thunder.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 63.917,
      "seconds": 5.28
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It has stopped. God help me, it has stopped.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 74.667,
      "seconds": 4.04
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I hid in a cabmen's shelter till after midnight. Before dawn, a third machine stood on Primrose Hill.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 79.208,
      "seconds": 7.12
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I meant to die there. Then I saw the birds on its hood, and I ran.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 86.833,
      "seconds": 4.81
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I waded breast-high through the flood.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 92.167,
      "seconds": 2.75
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Brown shreds hung from the hood, and the hungry birds tore at them.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 95.417,
      "seconds": 4.62
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Fear left me. Only a wild, trembling joy carried me up the hill.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 100.542,
      "seconds": 4.96
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I scrambled up the rampart. Below me lay the pit, and its fallen machines.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 106.042,
      "seconds": 5.17
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The Martians lay dead. Earth's smallest things, its germs, had killed them where men failed.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 111.75,
      "seconds": 7.31
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Dead! They are dead, every one of them!",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 119.583,
      "seconds": 2.46
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The sun rose and set the dead engines glittering, and my heart lightened with it.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 122.583,
      "seconds": 4.68
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "London was saved, and its healing would begin that very day.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 127.792,
      "seconds": 4.53
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Thank God. Thank God, the torment is over.",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 132.833,
      "seconds": 4.17
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then came the thought of my wife, and the old life gone for ever.",
      "shot": 25,
      "at": 138.708,
      "seconds": 4.42
    }
  ],
  "plan": "becd9095868f1388"
}